--- !u!114 &8765416642815733429
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1913378274030456682}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92cda9dba869e8846ada61f4c2962f54, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  menuName: 5
  pauseMenuController: {fileID: 524668921}
  onboardingData:
  - phase: 0
    titleText: CONTROLS
    bodyText: 'Use the Left Mouse Button [LMB] to click tiles and actions!


      Use
      the Right Mouse Button [RMB] to move the camera and look through the land!'
    animatedImage: {fileID: 84740251}
  - phase: 1
    titleText: PLANTING!
    bodyText: Use the Plant action to restore degraded land. Select a plant, choose
      where to grow it, and watch the ecosystem recover overtime!
    animatedImage: {fileID: 5341021480126589048}
  - phase: 2
    titleText: TIME LEFT AND WORKERS FATIGUE!
    bodyText: "Time only advances after you confirm an action. Each action consumes
      a number of days based on its duration. Every completed action also reduces
      your workers\u2019 energy, so be sure to not overwork them."
    animatedImage: {fileID: 495943411}
  - phase: 3
    titleText: WEATHER!
    bodyText: We may also use the weather to our advantage for maximizing work efficiency.
    animatedImage: {fileID: 1074110172}
  - phase: 4
    titleText: INSPECTOR PANEL!
    bodyText: "View the zone health and the selected tiles\u2019 stats to see what
      the soil needs and plan your next action."
    animatedImage: {fileID: 2010823045}
  - phase: 5
    titleText: CLEANING!
    bodyText: Use the Clean action to remove trash from the land. Clearing waste
      helps restore the environment and prevents further degredation.
    animatedImage: {fileID: 1898428332}
  - phase: 6
    titleText: END REPORT!
    bodyText: "Once our time is up, you\u2019ll receive an End Report summarizing
      your restoration efforts and the ecosystem\u2018s final condition, whether
      you succeeded or fall short of your goal."
    animatedImage: {fileID: 383337287}
  gifImage: {fileID: 0}
  title: {fileID: 3299835564044366976}
  body: {fileID: 8183485958346547853}
  nextButton: {fileID: 8556605711363449794}
  backButton: {fileID: 1429778837783714395}
